 "prompts": [
  "Subscriber CPE returns: home routers and set-top boxes come back in lots of one model and grade per week. Check every device has a factory-reset record, then refurbish and redeploy to new subscribers, sell to a broker, harvest parts or recycle. Lots under $20,000 are approved by policy.",
  "Decide per lot, not per device",
  "Redeploy only devices with a reset record"
 ],
